# EXCEPTION: STATUS.json is the canonical corpus-evidence-status
# registry (PROTOCOL v1.0 §2.7). It is metadata, not a generated
# corpus, and must be tracked. Narrow re-negation pattern: list the
# specific canonical metadata file as an exception. Future agents
# can simply `git add` the file without needing `-f`.
!/phase-1/conformance/STATUS.json
src/dewatacalendar/_version.py

